s always horde-bum-rush - it's equivalent to stealthing in Doom on harder difficulties (just makes no sense)\n\nI assume that this game is for workshop/warhammer fans only (the story/characters) - everything aside, I still appreciate the fact that warhammer series exists (strategic side of games, not ♥♥♥♥♥♥-quick cash grabs like this)\n\n\nPS: repetitive as ♥♥♥♥, and I actually like Orcs Must Die\n\nNot recommended because there is no middle-room", "timestamp_created": 1535757756, "timestamp_updated": 1535757756, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.381045430898666382", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44497080", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014097607", "personaname": "Schizm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/schizm82/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 907, "last_played": 1482627586, "avatar": "f0ed5f077fda29636a99a4d8577a1bb9c04e6743"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game", "timestamp_created": 1535756967, "timestamp_updated": 1535756967, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.447761178016662598", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}